00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:08.720
with this thorny problem.

341
00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:12.360
a newer. simpler missile
steals the crowbar's thunder.

342
00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.240
While it was under development.

343
00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.600
we finished the development
of our minuteman

344
00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:18.440
intercontinental ballistic missile.

345
00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:21.200
Once we had the minuteman.
we didn't really need

346
00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:22.960
the flying crowbar any longer.

347
00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:26.040
Only months after a
successful reactor test.

348
00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.360
project pluto is quietly canceled.

349
00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:32.360
It has cost the equivalent of $2 billion.

350
00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:36.240
Project pluto is not only
shockingly expensive.

351
00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:40.400
it's a totally indiscriminate
weapon of mass destruction.

352
00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.320
So the government buries the details

353
00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.640
under top secret
classification for decades.

354
00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:47.640
Finally. in 2015. the
department of energy

355
00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:50.680
