an extraordinary document.

356
00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:54.360
It details how truly deadly

357
00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:57.600
the flying crowbar would have been.

358
00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.160
It shows the united states
government was willing

359
00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:02.680
to try just about anything
to give it an advantage

360
00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:04.080
over the Soviet union.

361
00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.920
Project pluto would have been one

362
00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:09.000
of the most devastating
weapons ever created.

363
00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:14.040
Coming up. during
the Cuban missile crisis.

