00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:23.520
The two crews are basically
staring each other down.

367
00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:33.040
In the darkest hour of
the Cuban missile crisis.

368
00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:37.000
the future of humanity hangs
on a single Soviet submariner

369
00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:39.000
stranded beneath the waves

370
00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:42.360
in order to fire a nuclear torpedo.

371
00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.520
It's October 1962.

372
00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.920
Soviet premier nikita khrushchev has

