00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:22.000
Also on board is the
cool headed 36-year-old

383
00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:25.120
commodore vasiliy arkhipov.

384
00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:30.160
For this special mission.
b-59 is packing an extra punch.

385
00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.920
Alongside conventional weapons.

386
00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:34.840
it's loaded with a single nuclear torpedo

