388
00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:43.840
As b-59 is crossing the Atlantic.

389
00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:46.480
U.S. spy planes spot the secret nukes

390
00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:49.080
khrushchev has smuggled into Cuba.

391
00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.200
and all hell breaks loose.

392
00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:54.760
President Kennedy
orders the Navy to surround

393
00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.720
