00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:17.120
sailing into a vastly
more dangerous situation

401
00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:19.336
than the one that they
thought they were sailing into

402
00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.680
when they departed the Soviet union.

403
00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:24.880
The U.S. Navy is watching
the seas around Cuba.

404
00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.120
hunting for Soviet subs.

405
00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:31.400
On October 27th. the b-59 gets spotted.

406
00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:33.600
Its secret mission is exposed.

407
00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:37.480
