00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:23.880
It has every appearance of war.

423
00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.160
Captain savitsky decides that the U.S.

424
00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:28.320
Is coming in for the kill.

425
00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:29.800
He was given rules of engagement

426
00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:31.720
when he departed the Soviet union.

