00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:09.760
Commodore vasiliy arkhipov.

441
00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:11.720
Arkhipov isn't buying it.

442
00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:14.120
Arkhipov realized that.
if these guys wanted us.

