00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:21.200
This is theater... not
shooting directly at you.

446
00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:22.960
but shooting near you.

447
00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:26.480
So he takes these explosions
to mean that the Americans

