459
00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:04.040
The two crews are basically
staring each other down.

460
00:23:04.160 --> 00:23:06.000
They're right next to one another.

461
00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:07.920
The U.S. Navy doesn't board the sub.

