808
00:39:26.880 --> 00:39:28.976
Soviet agents in Europe are
reporting this back to Moscow.

809
00:39:29.000 --> 00:39:30.560
and Moscow is freaking out.

810
00:39:30.680 --> 00:39:32.880
As far as they're concerned.
this looks like exactly

811
00:39:33.000 --> 00:39:34.560
